_memory_mb\' (float). The function documents limitations: tracemalloc reports only Python memory allocations, not native extensions; psutil RSS includes total memory but may miss short-lived peaks unless polled; for robust peak measurement users should run in an environment with tracemalloc available or external profilers.", "params": [{"name": "func", "type": "Callable"}, {"name": "args", "type": "tuple"}, {"name": "kwargs", "type": "dict"}, {"name": "use_tracemalloc_first", "type": "bool"}], "returns": {"type": "dict"}}]\n\n## 参考代码（若有）\n无\n\n## 项目中可用的数据文件\n[{"path": "data/ircolitis_blood_cd8_obs.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 21.11, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/ircolitis_blood_cd8_pcs.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 28.15, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/ircolitis_blood_cd8_pcs_harmonized.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 28.16, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/lisi_lisi.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.01, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/lisi_metadata.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.0, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/lisi_x.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.01, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/pbmc_3500_meta.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.01, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/pbmc_3500_pcs.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.91, "ext": ".gz"}, {"path": "data/pbmc_3500_pcs_harmonized.tsv.gz", "size_mb": 0.91, "ext": ".gz"}]\n\n请实现该函数体，输出 JSON 对象。\n'}], 'model': 'openai/gpt-5-mini', 'max_tokens': 4096, 'response_format': {'type': 'json_schema', 'json_schema': {'name': 'arch_codegen', 'schema': {'type': 'object', 'required': ['body', 'imports'], 'additionalProperties': False, 'properties': {'body': {'type': 'string', 'minLength': 1, 'description': '函数体代码，\\n 换行，4空格缩进，不含 def 行'}, 'imports': {'type': 'array', 'items': {'type': 'string', 'minLength': 1}, 'description': '该函数体需要的外部库 import 语句列表，如 ["import torch", "import numpy as np"]；无外部依赖则填 []'}}}, 'strict': True}}, 'temperature': 0.2}}
